#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# 构建产物与发布物不进仓库（APK 体积大，走 GitHub Releases）
*.apk
*.aab
*.zip
/build/
/docs/screenshots/*.mp4

# 例外：随包分发的离线语音模型是构建必需资源，必须入库
!assets/speech/*.zip

# 本机环境与签名材料（含绝对路径 / 私钥，禁止入库）
android/local.properties
android/.gradle/
android/.cxx/
**/.gradle/
**/.cxx/
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties
*.p12
*.p8
google-services.json

# 内部交接文档（仅本地交付，不随仓库公开）
HANDOVER.md
